# 13. Enterprise inference hooks

Determine whether ZCoder's previous classification is correct.

Important distinction:

Inference hooks govern prompts on Anthropic Enterprise surfaces.

They are not automatically a normal Messages API feature.

Determine exactly what customers can configure programmatically versus through Enterprise administration.

If the configuration is not exposed through a public API suitable for ZCoder:

```text
DO NOT INVENT AN API
```

Instead implement only useful documented support such as:

* configuration documentation
* webhook/security-server example if appropriate
* signature verification helper if officially specified
* health-check tooling if legitimate
* observability interpretation

Classify remaining control-plane configuration as:

```text
CONSOLE_OR_ENTERPRISE_ADMIN_ONLY
```

when appropriate.

