# 16. Anthropic SDK upgrade audit

Determine the **current stable Anthropic Python SDK version at execution time**.

Compare with repository requirements.

Do not blindly upgrade.

Produce:

```text
current pinned/minimum
current upstream stable
minimum required for each used feature
breaking changes
deprecated SDK calls
raw HTTP dependencies
migration risk
```

Prefer SDK-native implementations when they provide:

* validated types
* stable streaming
* response metadata
* retries
* pagination
* beta namespaces

Keep raw HTTP only when justified.

