# 17. Transport normalization

If architecture warrants it, provide one shared transport boundary:

```text
AnthropicTransport
├── SDKTransport
├── RawHTTPTransport
└── MockTransport
```

Normalize:

```python
AnthropicResponse[T](
    data=T,
    request_id=...,
    workspace_id=...,
    rate_limits=...,
    model=...,
    usage=...,
    service_tier=...,
    inference_geo=...,
)
```

Backward compatibility is mandatory.

Do not force a repository-wide rewrite if small adapters solve the issue.

