# 26. Final report

Return exactly these sections.

## 1. Previous Gate Claims Disproved

Table:

```text
Claim | Previous status | Authoritative reality | Code impact | Fixed
```

If none, explicitly say none.

## 2. Previous Gate Claims Verified

Evidence-based list.

## 3. Runtime Bugs Fixed

Exact behavior and files.

## 4. Pricing Corrections

Old vs current values.

## 5. Header / Metadata Corrections

Request versus response semantics.

## 6. Model Registry Corrections

Including platform-specific availability.

## 7. Newly Discovered Anthropic Features

```text
Priority | Feature | Source date | Old status | New implementation
```

## 8. SDK / Claude Code Synchronization

What changed and what was intentionally not imported.

## 9. Tests Added

List independent regression/conformance tests.

## 10. Final Test Results

Exact commands and totals.

## 11. Remaining Gaps

Only genuine:

```text
private preview
account entitlement
console-only
platform-only
no public API
intentionally out of scope
```

## 12. Release Version

Chosen version + SemVer justification.

## 13. Files Changed

Exact paths.

## 14. Source-of-Truth Snapshot

```text
Anthropic API release notes latest entry:
Models docs verified:
Pricing verified:
Agent SDK verified:
Claude Code changelog verified:
Audit execution date:
```

## 15. Final Verdict

Do **not** say:

```text
100% Anthropic support
complete
fully verified
zero gaps
```

unless every applicable public feature has:

1. an authoritative source;
2. an implementation disposition;
3. wire-format verification where applicable;
4. test coverage;
5. CLI/shared-service wiring where applicable.

A green test suite alone is not sufficient evidence for a PASS.
